  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">一款顯示遊戲內 FPS 的 Fabric 模組<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/336/271/mod-preview.png\" alt=\"此模組的預覽畫面\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1008\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📗</span>&nbsp;</span><strong>關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">此模組會在畫面上顯示您目前的 FPS。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">支援最新版本 Minecraft，向下相容至 1.14.4。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">必須已安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a>！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🐞 錯誤與問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Grayray75/FPS-Display/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上回報任何錯誤或問題。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">❔</span>常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">您會將此模組移植到 Forge 嗎？</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"> <strong>不會</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;color:#000\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">我可以在我的整合包中使用此模組嗎？</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000\">可以</span></strong></span></span></span></p>",
